12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">첨부의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">신청원을 작성하여 소속 학과장을 경유</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">날인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">한 후 신청장소에 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">5.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold;\">제출서류&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">포기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">원&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">부</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">6.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">참고사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">추가이수과정 이수자로 선발되었으나 졸업 전 이수가 불가능할 경우에는 반드시 이수 포기 신청을 하여야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 35.7pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -35.7pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">추가이수과정 이수 불가 시 졸업할 수 없음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">복수전공을 부전공으로 변경하고자 할 때에는 이수 성적이 평점평균&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">3.00&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">이상 이어야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">성적증명서 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33.2pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">추가이수과정을 포기한 경우 기 취득한 학점은 일반선택 학점으로 인정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 35.7pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -35.7pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">복수전공에서 부전공으로 변경하는 경우에는 부전공 학점으로 인정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 54.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -54.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;※&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2010</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">학년도 이전에 수강한 추가이수과정 과목은 이수 구분 변경원을 별도로 제출하여야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 35pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -35pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2024. 10.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 22.4px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; font-size: 16pt;\">교 무 처 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
